<"'!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="A little space for your next big idea. Compare Marginalia'"'s Starter, Pro, and Team note-taking plans.\">
